      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEZA PUNK ROCKER NZ (6) has led to win in good style in both outings at this venue since joining Jason Grimson, getting home by 7.7m last week. Back in distance but has won at it before. Draws off the pegs this time but has the speed to get across from there so is the one to beat. JUNGLE DRAGON (3) has done a great job to come from the back row and win his last two outings here, the latest when racing parked but digging deep. Has won three of five tries at this shorter distance so could land the hat trick. HES NO ROMEO NZ (2) has put together a string of good efforts including a win from the back line two back. Draws for another good showing. FREE THINKER (4) has been solid in two outings here since a Redcliffe win. First four hope.",
